# Nothing here is needed to build, run, or publish the app.
#
# `pnpm install`, `pnpm dev` and `pnpm build:win` all work without a .env; the
# application creates and migrates its own database under Electron's userData.
# This file previously carried DATABASE_URL for Prisma, which the app no longer
# uses at all.
#
# It also previously carried GH_TOKEN, because publishing went through
# electron-builder. Releases are now uploaded by `pnpm release:win`, which uses
# the GitHub CLI's own credentials (`gh auth login`) - so no token is stored in
# the repo at all. See docs/releasing.md.
#
# The file is kept only so that this explanation has somewhere to live.
